From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 15:29:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] presentation: synchronize floating navigation without moving
 browsing content

Move title and categories as one overlay, share a 140ms direction-triggered animation with the bottom bar, and keep viewport and scroll padding constant. Wide or short windows use 48dp toolbar and bottom touch rows; large fonts retain normal sizing. Shared chrome and compact navigation match Anikku 0050; keep Mihon tablet navigation suite.
